{"title":"Career Roadmap · Mineral Resource Analyst","role":"Mineral Resource Analyst","summary":"A Mineral Resource Analyst evaluates geological, geochemical, geophysical, drilling and sampling data to understand the quantity, quality, distribution and economic potential of mineral deposits.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Geological / Applied Geology Engineering"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Mineral Resource Analyst evaluates geological, geochemical, geophysical, drilling and sampling data to understand the quantity, quality, distribution and economic potential of mineral deposits."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Economic Geology","Exploration","Geostatistics","Resource Estimation","GIS","3D Geological Modelling","Data Analytics","Mining Economics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical work includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Geological data management"},{"text":"Drill-hole data analysis"},{"text":"Geological interpretation"},{"text":"Assay data validation"},{"text":"Grade estimation"},{"text":"Mineral-domain modelling"},{"text":"Geostatistical analysis"},{"text":"Block modelling"},{"text":"Resource classification"},{"text":"Resource reporting"},{"text":"Exploration targeting"},{"text":"Mineral inventory analysis"},{"text":"Uncertainty assessment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong modern profile combines geology with statistics, geospatial technology and computational modelling rather than relying only on field geology."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Tech/B.E. Geological / Applied Geology Engineering"},{"text":"Economic geology, mineral exploration, GIS, geostatistics and geological data"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Junior Mineral Resource Analyst / Resource Geologist"},{"text":"Drill-hole analysis, QA/QC, geological interpretation and block modelling"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior Resource Analyst / Resource Geologist"},{"text":"Geostatistics, resource estimation, uncertainty and technical reporting"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Principal Resource Geologist / Mineral Resource Specialist"},{"text":"Resource governance, major deposits, technical leadership and strategic evaluation"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Tech/B.E.","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Geological & Quantitative Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong foundations in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Calculus"},{"text":"Linear algebra"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Differential equations"},{"text":"Numerical methods"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Geology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Physical geology"},{"text":"Mineralogy"},{"text":"Petrology"},{"text":"Structural geology"},{"text":"Geomorphology"},{"text":"Stratigraphy"},{"text":"Historical geology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mechanics"},{"text":"Basic materials science"},{"text":"Surveying"},{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"Engineering drawing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is to understand both the geological system and the quantitative methods required to estimate resources from incomplete observations."},{"type":"h","text":"Mineralogy"},{"type":"p","text":"Master identification and characteristics of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Quartz"},{"text":"Feldspar"},{"text":"Mica"},{"text":"Calcite"},{"text":"Dolomite"},{"text":"Pyroxenes"},{"text":"Amphiboles"},{"text":"Olivine"},{"text":"Garnet"},{"text":"Clay minerals"},{"text":"Sulfides"},{"text":"Oxides"},{"text":"Carbonates"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Crystal structure"},{"text":"Chemical composition"},{"text":"Hardness"},{"text":"Density"},{"text":"Cleavage"},{"text":"Alteration"},{"text":"Mineral associations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Petrology"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"h","text":"Igneous"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Granite"},{"text":"Diorite"},{"text":"Gabbro"},{"text":"Basalt"},{"text":"Pegmatite"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sedimentary"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sandstone"},{"text":"Shale"},{"text":"Limestone"},{"text":"Conglomerate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Metamorphic"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Slate"},{"text":"Schist"},{"text":"Gneiss"},{"text":"Marble"},{"text":"Quartzite"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Connect rock types with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mineralization"},{"text":"Alteration"},{"text":"Porosity"},{"text":"Permeability"},{"text":"Structural controls"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1–2 — Economic Geology"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the core geological foundation for the career."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ore deposits"},{"text":"Mineral systems"},{"text":"Mineralization"},{"text":"Alteration"},{"text":"Host rocks"},{"text":"Ore minerals"},{"text":"Gangue minerals"},{"text":"Hydrothermal systems"},{"text":"Magmatic deposits"},{"text":"Sedimentary deposits"},{"text":"Metamorphic deposits"},{"text":"Supergene enrichment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand major deposit types:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Porphyry"},{"text":"Epithermal"},{"text":"VMS"},{"text":"SEDEX"},{"text":"Orogenic gold"},{"text":"IOCG"},{"text":"MVT"},{"text":"Laterite"},{"text":"Banded iron formation"},{"text":"Pegmatite"},{"text":"Placer deposits"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mineral Systems Thinking"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of simply asking:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Where is the ore?\""},{"type":"p","text":"learn to ask:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Source","Transport","Fluid / Melt","Pathway","Trap","Alteration","Mineralization","Deposit"]},{"type":"p","text":"This helps identify geological controls on mineralization."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Mineral Exploration"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the exploration cycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regional Geology","Remote Sensing","Geophysical Survey","Geochemical Survey","Target Generation","Drilling","Sampling","Assay","Resource Evaluation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Exploration Methods"},{"type":"h","text":"Geological Exploration"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Geological mapping"},{"text":"Structural mapping"},{"text":"Alteration mapping"},{"text":"Mineral identification"},{"text":"Lithological interpretation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Geochemical Exploration"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Soil sampling"},{"text":"Rock sampling"},{"text":"Stream sediment sampling"},{"text":"Heavy mineral sampling"},{"text":"Pathfinders"},{"text":"Anomalies"},{"text":"Background vs anomalous populations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Geophysical Exploration"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Magnetic surveys"},{"text":"Gravity"},{"text":"Electrical resistivity"},{"text":"Induced polarization"},{"text":"Electromagnetic methods"},{"text":"Radiometric surveys"},{"text":"Seismic methods"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3 — Drill-Hole Data"},{"type":"p","text":"Drilling is one of the most important sources of resource-estimation data."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"RC drilling"},{"text":"Diamond drilling"},{"text":"Reverse circulation"},{"text":"Core logging"},{"text":"Downhole surveys"},{"text":"Geological intervals"},{"text":"Sample intervals"},{"text":"Assay intervals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Drilling","Core Recovery","Geological Logging","Sampling","Laboratory Assay","QA/QC","Validated Database","Resource Estimation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Drill-Core Logging"},{"type":"p","text":"Record:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lithology"},{"text":"Alteration"},{"text":"Mineralization"},{"text":"Veining"},{"text":"Structure"},{"text":"Weathering"},{"text":"Recovery"},{"text":"RQD"},{"text":"Mineral percentages"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to distinguish:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Geological observations"},{"text":"Interpretations"},{"text":"Quantitative measurements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Assay Data"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grade"},{"text":"Detection limits"},{"text":"Below-detection values"},{"text":"High-grade values"},{"text":"Sample intervals"},{"text":"Composite samples"},{"text":"Laboratory methods"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Common commodities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gold"},{"text":"Copper"},{"text":"Iron"},{"text":"Lithium"},{"text":"Nickel"},{"text":"Cobalt"},{"text":"Zinc"},{"text":"Lead"},{"text":"Manganese"},{"text":"Rare earth elements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"QA/QC"},{"type":"p","text":"A resource estimate is only as reliable as its underlying data."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Certified reference materials"},{"text":"Blanks"},{"text":"Duplicates"},{"text":"Laboratory duplicates"},{"text":"Check assays"},{"text":"Sample insertion rates"},{"text":"Detection limits"},{"text":"Laboratory performance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Samples","Standards + Blanks + Duplicates","Laboratory Assay","QA/QC Review","Data Validation","Resource Database"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contamination"},{"text":"Bias"},{"text":"Precision problems"},{"text":"Outliers"},{"text":"Sample mix-ups"},{"text":"Batch effects"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3 — Geological Database Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to manage:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collar data"},{"text":"Survey data"},{"text":"Lithology"},{"text":"Assays"},{"text":"Alteration"},{"text":"Mineralization"},{"text":"Density"},{"text":"Geochemistry"},{"text":"Understand relational database concepts."}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"PostGIS"},{"text":"Excel"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Data validation should check:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing intervals"},{"text":"Overlapping intervals"},{"text":"Invalid coordinates"},{"text":"Duplicate samples"},{"text":"Impossible depths"},{"text":"Incorrect assay units"},{"text":"Inconsistent geological codes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"GIS"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"ArcGIS"},{"text":"Coordinate systems"},{"text":"Raster/vector data"},{"text":"Geological maps"},{"text":"Spatial joins"},{"text":"Buffering"},{"text":"Terrain analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use GIS for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Exploration targeting"},{"text":"Geological mapping"},{"text":"Drill-hole visualization"},{"text":"Mineral occurrences"},{"text":"Geochemical anomalies"},{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"Tenement analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Remote Sensing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Multispectral imagery"},{"text":"Hyperspectral concepts"},{"text":"DEMs"},{"text":"Satellite alteration mapping"},{"text":"Lineament extraction"},{"text":"Spectral signatures"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful applications:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Alteration mapping"},{"text":"Lithological mapping"},{"text":"Structural interpretation"},{"text":"Exploration targeting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Platforms:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Earth Engine"},{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"ArcGIS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Geostatistics"},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important technical areas for a Mineral Resource Analyst."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Probability distributions"},{"text":"Spatial statistics"},{"text":"Variograms"},{"text":"Covariance"},{"text":"Anisotropy"},{"text":"Spatial continuity"},{"text":"Kriging"},{"text":"Estimation uncertainty"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Exploratory Data Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean"},{"text":"Median"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Standard deviation"},{"text":"Coefficient of variation"},{"text":"Percentiles"},{"text":"Histograms"},{"text":"Probability plots"},{"text":"Pay particular attention to highly skewed grade distributions."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Variograms"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Nugget"},{"text":"Sill"},{"text":"Range"},{"text":"Experimental variogram"},{"text":"Directional variograms"},{"text":"Variogram models"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Common models:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Spherical"},{"text":"Exponential"},{"text":"Gaussian"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Conceptually:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sample Pairs","Distance","Grade Differences","Experimental Variogram","Model Fitting","Spatial Continuity"]},{"type":"h","text":"Kriging"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Ordinary Kriging"},{"type":"p","text":"For estimating spatially varying grades."},{"type":"h","text":"Simple Kriging"},{"type":"p","text":"When a known global mean can reasonably be assumed."},{"type":"h","text":"Indicator Kriging"},{"type":"p","text":"For categorical/threshold-based estimation."},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Search neighbourhood"},{"text":"Search ellipsoid"},{"text":"Anisotropy"},{"text":"Sample support"},{"text":"Block support"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Compositing"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand why drill-hole samples may need to be composited before estimation."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Composite length"},{"text":"Dominant sample length"},{"text":"Grade weighting"},{"text":"Boundary treatment"},{"text":"Density/volume support"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Top-Cutting / Capping"},{"type":"p","text":"High-grade outliers can disproportionately influence resource estimates."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"High-grade outliers"},{"text":"Statistical thresholds"},{"text":"Top-cut levels"},{"text":"Domain-specific capping"},{"text":"Sensitivity analysis"},{"text":"Do not blindly remove high values; the geological context must be considered."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Geological Domaining"},{"type":"p","text":"A critical principle:"},{"type":"p","text":"Estimate grades within geologically meaningful domains rather than treating an entire deposit as statistically homogeneous."},{"type":"p","text":"Domains can be defined using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lithology"},{"text":"Alteration"},{"text":"Mineralization"},{"text":"Structure"},{"text":"Grade continuity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Geological Interpretation","Mineralized Domains","Statistical Analysis","Variography","Estimation","Validation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Density"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand bulk density because resource volume must be converted into tonnage."},{"type":"p","text":"Conceptually:"},{"type":"p","text":"\\[ Tonnage = Volume \\times Bulk\\ Density \\]"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Specific gravity"},{"text":"Bulk density"},{"text":"Oxidation effects"},{"text":"Weathering effects"},{"text":"Lithological variation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4 — 3D Geological Modelling"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to construct:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Geological wireframes"},{"text":"Mineralized domains"},{"text":"Fault models"},{"text":"Lithological surfaces"},{"text":"Alteration models"},{"text":"Grade shells"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drill Holes"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Geological Mapping"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Geophysics"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Geochemistry","3D Geological Interpretation","Geological Domains"]},{"type":"h","text":"Block Modelling"},{"type":"p","text":"A block model divides a deposit into 3D cells."},{"type":"p","text":"Each block may contain:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Coordinates"},{"text":"Volume"},{"text":"Density"},{"text":"Rock type"},{"text":"Estimated grade"},{"text":"Classification"},{"text":"Economic parameters"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Concept:"},{"type":"flow","items":["3D Deposit","Block Model","Sample Data","Estimation","Grade per Block","Resource Classification"]},{"type":"h","text":"Resource Estimation Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Geological Database","Data Validation","Geological Domains","Statistical Analysis","Compositing","Top-Cut / Capping","Variography","Density Model","Block Model","Grade Estimation","Validation","Resource Classification","Mineral Resource Statement"]},{"type":"h","text":"Resource Classification"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the distinction between levels of geological confidence."},{"type":"p","text":"Common categories include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Inferred"},{"text":"Indicated"},{"text":"Measured"},{"text":"The exact reporting framework depends on the applicable reporting code and jurisdiction."}]},{"type":"p","text":"The analyst must understand that resource classification is fundamentally about geological confidence and estimation uncertainty, not simply about grade."},{"type":"h","text":"Mineral Resources vs Mineral Reserves"},{"type":"p","text":"This distinction is essential."},{"type":"h","text":"Mineral Resource"},{"type":"p","text":"A concentration of material with reasonable prospects for eventual economic extraction, subject to the applicable reporting framework."},{"type":"h","text":"Mineral Reserve"},{"type":"p","text":"The economically mineable portion of a measured and/or indicated resource after considering relevant modifying factors."},{"type":"flow","items":["Exploration","Mineralization","Mineral Resource","Economic / Technical Evaluation","Mineral Reserve"]},{"type":"p","text":"Modifying factors can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mining"},{"text":"Processing"},{"text":"Metallurgy"},{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Legal factors"},{"text":"Environmental constraints"},{"text":"Social considerations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Resource Validation"},{"type":"p","text":"Never assume that a model is correct simply because software produced it."},{"type":"p","text":"Validate:"},{"type":"h","text":"Visual Validation"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Block grades"},{"text":"Drill-hole grades"},{"text":"Geological domains"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Statistical Validation"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean grades"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Distribution"},{"text":"Swath plots"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Spatial Validation"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare estimates against:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drill-hole spacing"},{"text":"Directional continuity"},{"text":"Geological interpretation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sensitivity Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Test how estimates respond to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cut-off grade"},{"text":"Top cuts"},{"text":"Search parameters"},{"text":"Variogram models"},{"text":"Density"},{"text":"Composite length"},{"text":"Geological domains"},{"text":"This helps quantify uncertainty."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cut-Off Grade"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand that cut-off grade can significantly change:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reported tonnage"},{"text":"Average grade"},{"text":"Contained metal"},{"text":"Potential economic value"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Conceptually:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Cut-off Grade","Material Selection","Tonnage"]},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Grade","Contained Metal"]},{"type":"p","text":"Economic assumptions must be clearly separated from purely geological estimates."},{"type":"h","text":"Mineral Economics"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop basic understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Commodity prices"},{"text":"Operating costs"},{"text":"Capital costs"},{"text":"Recovery"},{"text":"Mining costs"},{"text":"Processing costs"},{"text":"Royalties"},{"text":"Cut-off grades"},{"text":"Net value"},{"text":"Sensitivity analysis"},{"text":"You do not need to become a mining economist at undergraduate level, but should understand how geology connects to economic decisions."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Metallurgy Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ore mineralogy"},{"text":"Liberation"},{"text":"Recovery"},{"text":"Concentration"},{"text":"Crushing"},{"text":"Grinding"},{"text":"Flotation"},{"text":"Leaching"},{"text":"Gravity separation"},{"text":"Magnetic separation"},{"text":"Understand that an apparently large geological resource may not necessarily translate into an economically viable reserve."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Software"},{"type":"p","text":"Build exposure to professional geological/resource software."},{"type":"h","text":"Geological Modelling"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Leapfrog"},{"text":"Micromine"},{"text":"Datamine"},{"text":"Surpac"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Geostatistics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Isatis.neo"},{"text":"Geovariances concepts"},{"text":"Python-based geostatistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"GIS"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"ArcGIS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualization"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"3D geological visualization tools"},{"text":"Software names and licensing vary by organization; prioritize transferable modelling concepts over becoming dependent on one package."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python for Mineral Resources"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful libraries:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"SciPy"},{"text":"Matplotlib"},{"text":"scikit-learn"},{"text":"GeoPandas"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Applications:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drill-hole data cleaning"},{"text":"Assay statistics"},{"text":"Variogram calculations"},{"text":"Grade distribution analysis"},{"text":"QA/QC"},{"text":"Resource-model validation"},{"text":"Automated reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Machine Learning"},{"type":"p","text":"ML can complement traditional geological modelling."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential applications:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Exploration targeting"},{"text":"Geological classification"},{"text":"Lithology prediction"},{"text":"Alteration classification"},{"text":"Geochemical anomaly detection"},{"text":"Mineral prospectivity mapping"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Geology"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Geochemistry"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Geophysics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Remote Sensing"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Structural Data","Machine Learning","Prospectivity Model","Exploration Targets"]},{"type":"p","text":"ML should be treated as a supporting method; geological reasoning, data quality and appropriate validation remain essential."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project Ideas"}]},{"heading":"Mineral Resource Block Model","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build a simplified 3D block model using drill-hole data."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Geological domains"},{"text":"Compositing"},{"text":"Variography"},{"text":"Kriging"},{"text":"Validation"}]}]},{"heading":"Gold/Copper Resource Estimation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Perform an academic resource-estimation workflow from a suitable public or synthetic dataset."}]},{"heading":"Geochemical Anomaly Detection","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Analyse soil/rock geochemistry and identify exploration targets."}]},{"heading":"Mineral Prospectivity Mapping","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Geology"},{"text":"Geophysics"},{"text":"Geochemistry"},{"text":"Remote sensing"}]}]},{"heading":"Drill-Hole QA/QC Dashboard","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build a dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Blanks"},{"text":"Standards"},{"text":"Duplicates"},{"text":"Assay bias"},{"text":"Precision"},{"text":"Batch performance"}]}]},{"heading":"3D Geological Model","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Drill holes","geological domains","mineralized wireframes","block model"]}]},{"heading":"AI Exploration Targeting","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Train a model to rank areas based on geological evidence."},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize internships that provide actual geological data exposure, not only generic office work."},{"type":"h","text":"Exploration"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mineral exploration"},{"text":"Geological mapping"},{"text":"Geochemistry"},{"text":"Geophysics"},{"text":"Drilling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mining"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mine geology"},{"text":"Resource estimation"},{"text":"Grade control"},{"text":"Geological modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Resource Consulting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Resource estimation"},{"text":"Geostatistics"},{"text":"Technical reporting"},{"text":"Database management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"GIS / Remote Sensing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Geological GIS"},{"text":"Remote sensing"},{"text":"Prospectivity mapping"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Economic geology"},{"text":"Geostatistics"},{"text":"Mineral systems"},{"text":"Exploration technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Entry-Level Career Options"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mineral Resource Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Resource Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Resource Geologist"},{"text":"Resource Geologist"},{"text":"Geological Dat